     2952         bf_tt-allsum-line.vat-rubl-buyer-cur   =  (bf_tt-allsum-line.sum-dsc-rubl-cur - bf_tt-allsum-line.slt-rubl-cur) * bf_doc-line.vat-pc / (100 + bf_doc-line.vat-pc)
